By \cref{cor:ExpOfcappedXk}~(ii), with probability at least $1-n^{-\log n/4}$,
  for every set of vertices $S$ with $ s\ge (\log n)^{b}$, where $b\ge 3$ and every $k\in[s, n -  s - 1]$ we thus have
  \begin{equation} \left|\sum_{i= s}^k \mathbb{E}[\capped{X}^S_i \mid \mathcal A^S_{i-1}] - \sum_{i= s}^k \frac{1}{i(n-i) + 1} \right|
    \le \max
